          "reading": "Moderator podvyol itogi diskussii, otmetiv vysokiy uroven konstruktivnosti vyskazannykh ekspertnykh predlozheniy.",
          "translation": "The moderator summed up the discussion, noting the high level of constructiveness of the expert proposals voiced."
